    "text": "newportdispatch.com\nwebsite\nSpringfield\nSpringfield police arrest man after recovering ghost gun from vehicle\nBy Daniel Duric,\n2 hours agoSPRINGFIELD — Springfield police officers seized a ghost gun and arrested 19-year-old Ethan Alicea on Tuesday. The arrest occurred at approximately 5 p.m. on Aug. 12 after officers observed a vehicle that was uninsured and did not have a license plate that matched the vehicle at a gas station on the 600 block of Carew Street.",
